{"title":"2019 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the diagram, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> is equilateral. Point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> is inside <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c3a2d2224f7d163b46d702132425d47828bf538.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/7/1a7a0327109ede54bf3abf9eb325bb58a503afc2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle BDC$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" /> is right angled at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> and has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/8/ec87796111549d416d298f281aa116f46b31b6ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DB = DC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/b/ecbd43e2c14c28788b02e1547194953cee702347.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABD = x^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/5/4057c3e63298c2ed6715003afb6f2d9dc6272037.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BDC$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> is an isosceles right triangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/b/79be07d02a6f7c6c375b579e6daf95c6d481739c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DBC = 45^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"109\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>Since triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> is equilateral, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/6/736551d53c76055672e2189bf1554d7c6dc956fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC = 60^{\\circ}$\" width=\"103\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/3/f93e72b9d2c86f197276a931aba77c472d0511c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABD$\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/e/68e80c71d8f08383352a558a07cd96d6c6fa293f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DBC$\" width=\"57\" height=\"12\" /> form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/a/a3ad57710b6810476e6017ea2c2cc6d41219c218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"57\" height=\"14\" />, so:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/d/80d1651d13afad5e6a4cc7abedcfd4b783a6d3a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x + 45 = 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"95\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/4/c5429aa5cc2036d9e11c30c9d1faab90cc3512db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 60 - 45 = \\boxed{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"149\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC\" title=\"2019 CIMC\">2019 CIMC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CIMC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CIMC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2019 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Part A 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_2\" title=\"2019 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 2\">Part A 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_3\" title=\"2019 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 3\">Part A 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_4\" title=\"2019 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 4\">Part A 4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">Part A 5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC_Problems/Part_A_Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CIMC Problems/Part A Problem 6 (page does not exist)\">Part A 6</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Part B 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Part B 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_CIMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2019 CIMC Problems/Part B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Part B 3</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Intermediate_Competition\" title=\"CEMC Intermediate Competition\">CEMC Intermediate Competition</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018062458\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 129/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1656/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 143/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2942/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTra